---
layout: base.njk
title: Pencil portrait commissions
description: "Custom pencil portraits of pets, people, wildlife, homes and boats by Boise artist Cindy Smith. Each commission is quoted by subject. Send your photos for a quote."
permalink: /commissions/
---
<div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Commissions</h1><p>{{ commissions.intro }}</p>
  <div class="subjects">{% for s in commissions.subjects %}<span>{{ s }}</span>{% endfor %}</div></div></div>
<div class="samples">
{% for s in commissions.samples %}<figure><div class="s">{% picture s.image, "Commissioned pencil drawing: " + s.caption, "(max-width: 900px) 46vw, 290px" %}</div><figcaption>{{ s.caption }}</figcaption></figure>
{% endfor %}
</div>
<div class="how{% if commissions.poster %} has-poster{% endif %}">
  {% if commissions.poster %}<figure class="poster"><a href="{{ commissions.poster }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open the commissions poster full size">{% picture commissions.poster, commissions.poster_alt, "(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 460px" %}</a><figcaption>Tap to see it full size</figcaption></figure>{% endif %}
  <div class="how-text">
  <div><h2>How pricing works</h2>{% for para in commissions.pricing.split("\n\n") %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
    <a class="btn cta" href="#request">Request a commission</a></div>
  <div><h2>How it works</h2><ol class="steps">{% for s in commissions.steps %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol>
    {% if commissions.sample_agreement %}<p class="agreement"><a href="{{ commissions.sample_agreement }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See a sample commission agreement (PDF)</a><span>The details are filled in for each commission.</span></p>{% endif %}</div>
  </div>
</div>
{% if commissions.faq.length %}
<section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
  <h2 id="faq-h">Questions people ask</h2>
  {% for q in commissions.faq %}<details><summary>{{ q.question }}</summary>{% for para in q.answer.split("\n\n") %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}</details>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}
<section class="request" aria-labelledby="req-h">
  <div><h2 id="req-h">Request a commission</h2><p>Tell Cindy who or what you'd like drawn and attach your best photos. She'll reply by email with a quote and an agreement to sign. Nothing is due until you've agreed to the quote.</p></div>
  {% set preset = "commission" %}{% include "contactform.njk" %}
</section>
